Cancel an individual proxy delay test when its API request is cancelled.
Based on upstream PR: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3317
Source commit: cb53dce54b77a77dae98dd57bdc1f94bca77ae8a

Derive the delay context from r.Context() while retaining the query timeout.
The shared handler also serves individual provider proxy health checks.
Deterministic tests check cancellation, an earlier request deadline and the
query timeout without opening a listener or making an outbound connection.

